// Hotaru, the little fairy who lives in your lantern (ADR-0061, redrawn at the world's own scale for ADR-0064):
// a girl about as tall as a barrel, short black hair with a red-orange clip, a dark dress with a red-orange sash and
// hem, pale blue fairy wings (two pairs). Each frame is 32 x 32 art pixels, one art pixel per world pixel; the game
// adds her soft light around her and a twinkle drawn here moves from one corner to the other with the wing beat.
// Per facing (down, up, left) the wings are up or down; she floats beside you, so her feet hang in the air.
// The notice above her head is a "!" in the glow colours, 7 x 15 (build.py cuts it out as hotaru-notice.png).

legend L hair_black.0
legend K hair_black.1
legend J hair_black.2
legend E eyes_teal.1
legend M cloth_black.0
legend H cloth_black.1
legend G cloth_black.2
legend R cloth_red.0
legend S cloth_red.1
legend T cloth_red.2
legend V cloth_sky.0
legend U cloth_sky.1
legend X cloth_sky.2
legend W cloth_white.0
legend N glow.0
legend Y glow.1
legend Z glow.2

sprite hotaru 32 32

